    <description><![CDATA[<h2>LIVE CLOUD COVER</h2><p>This entry auto-refreshes from the live overlay (source: NOAA/NCEP HRRR 3 km TCDC total cloud cover, entire-atmosphere analysis (hourly cycles + 15-min subhourly steps)).<br/><b>Data time:</b> 2026-09-25 12:00 PM EDT<br/><b>Source version:</b> hrrr-hrrr.20260925-t16z-tcdc-anl<br/><b>Status:</b> LIVE / CURRENT MODEL (hourly HRRR cycle, 15-min steps)</p><p>Turn on/off independently of all other layers. Add this file once; new source cycles appear automatically.</p><p><i>Not endorsed by NOAA.</i></p>]]></description>
